second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Who is Brenda Burrows's spouse?\", \"slot_hint\": \"person\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 97, \"text\": \"**SOCIETY SCOOP: Brenda Burrows Ties the Knot with George Nasson Johnstone in Whirlwind Romance**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 99, \"end\": 305, \"text\": \"LONDON, ENGLAND - In a surprise move that has left high society abuzz, Brenda Burrows, the esteemed member of the peerage, has married George Nasson Johnstone, a respected gentleman from a prominent family.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 306, \"end\": 446, \"text\": \"The whirlwind romance, which began just a few months ago, culminated in an intimate ceremony at a private estate in the English countryside.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 447, \"end\": 599, \"text\": \"According to sources close to the couple, Burrows, 35, and Johnstone, 83, met at a charity gala in London, where they were introduced by mutual friends.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 600, \"end\": 655, \"text\": \"The sparks flew, and the rest, as they say, is history.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 656, \"end\": 787, \"text\": \"\\\"I was immediately drawn to George's kind heart and sense of humor,\\\" Burrows gushed in an exclusive interview with our publication.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 788, \"end\": 889, \"text\": \"\\\"We bonded over our shared love of literature and philanthropy, and before I knew it, I was smitten.\\\"\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 890, \"end\": 1015, \"text\": \"Johnstone, a retired businessman, echoed Burrows' sentiments, saying, \\\"Brenda is an extraordinary woman with a heart of gold.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1016, \"end\": 1078, \"text\": \"I knew from the moment I met her that she was the one for me.\\\"\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1079, \"end\": 1244, \"text\": \"The couple's wedding, which took place on a crisp autumn morning, was attended by close friends and family, including several prominent figures from British society.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1245, \"end\": 1381, \"text\": \"Guests described the ceremony as \\\"intimate and romantic,\\\" with Burrows stunning in a bespoke lace gown and Johnstone beaming with pride.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1382, \"end\": 1498, \"text\": \"When asked about the significant age gap between them, Burrows laughed, saying, \\\"Love knows no bounds, not even age.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1499, \"end\": 1598, \"text\": \"George is an old soul with a young heart, and I'm the luckiest woman alive to have him by my side.\\\"\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1599, \"end\": 1741, \"text\": \"The newlyweds plan to split their time between London and their country estate, where they will focus on their shared philanthropic endeavors.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1742, \"end\": 1846, \"text\": \"According to sources, they are already making plans to establish a charitable foundation in their names.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1847, \"end\": 1960, \"text\": \"As news of the marriage spreads, friends and acquaintances are sending their congratulations to the happy couple.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1961, \"end\": 2065, \"text\": \"\\\"Brenda and George are a match made in heaven,\\\" said Lady Victoria Windsor, a close friend of the bride.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2066, \"end\": 2181, \"text\": \"\\\"They complement each other perfectly, and I have no doubt their love will continue to flourish for years to come.\\\"\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 110, \"text\": \"Title: A Life of Nobility and Devotion: The Enduring Bond of Brenda Burrows and Stephen Patrick Cass Alexander\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 112, \"end\": 233, \"text\": \"In the realm of British peerage, where lineage and heritage reign supreme, a remarkable union has stood the test of time.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 234, \"end\": 421, \"text\": \"Brenda Burrows, a woman of elegance and poise, has been married to Stephen Patrick Cass Alexander, a distinguished gentleman born in 1928, for a lifetime of love, loyalty, and dedication.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 422, \"end\": 580, \"text\": \"This narrative delves into the intricacies of their relationship, weaving together the threads of history, family, and devotion that have bound them together.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 581, \"end\": 700, \"text\": \"The Burrows family, with roots tracing back to the 18th century, has long been associated with the British aristocracy.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 701, \"end\": 798, \"text\": \"Brenda, a scion of this esteemed lineage, was born into a world of refinement and sophistication.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 799, \"end\": 959, \"text\": \"Her early life was marked by the traditional trappings of nobility: lavish estates, high-society gatherings, and a strong sense of duty to family and community.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 960, \"end\": 1109, \"text\": \"Meanwhile, Stephen Patrick Cass Alexander, a member of the Alexander clan, was born in 1928, during a time of great change and upheaval in the world.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1110, \"end\": 1225, \"text\": \"His family, too, boasted a rich history, with connections to the Scottish peerage and a legacy of military service.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1226, \"end\": 1360, \"text\": \"As a young man, Stephen was instilled with the values of honor, duty, and loyalty, which would serve him well in his future endeavors.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1361, \"end\": 1468, \"text\": \"The paths of Brenda and Stephen converged in the post-war era, a time of rebuilding and renewal in Britain.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1469, \"end\": 1560, \"text\": \"It was an era of great social change, as the old aristocracy gave way to a new meritocracy.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1561, \"end\": 1639, \"text\": \"Amidst this backdrop, the two met, and their lives became forever intertwined.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1640, \"end\": 1744, \"text\": \"Their marriage, a union of love and mutual respect, was a testament to the enduring power of commitment.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1745, \"end\": 1906, \"text\": \"Together, they navigated the complexities of noble life, hosting lavish gatherings, supporting charitable causes, and upholding the traditions of their families.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1907, \"end\": 2093, \"text\": \"Brenda, with her keen sense of style and elegance, proved a gracious hostess, while Stephen, with his military background and sense of duty, provided a steady hand and guiding influence.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2094, \"end\": 2190, \"text\": \"As the years passed, their bond grew stronger, a testament to the power of devotion and loyalty.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2191, \"end\": 2436, \"text\": \"They faced challenges, to be sure – the decline of the British aristocracy, the rise of modernity, and the inevitable trials of aging – but through it all, their love remained a constant, a beacon of hope and stability in an ever-changing world.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [], \"R5_answers\": [\"George Nasson Johnstone\", \"Stephen Patrick Cass Alexander\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"George Nasson Johnstone\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Stephen Patrick Cass Alexander\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
